      "text": "//consulta de chat\r\nval año = 2016\r\n\r\nval dfAnio = dfWeather\r\n  .filter(\r\n    year(col(\"Formatted Date\")) === año \r\n  )\r\n\r\nz.show(\r\n  dfAnio\r\n    .groupBy(to_date(col(\"Formatted Date\")).alias(\"Fecha\"))\r\n    .agg(avg(\"Temperature (C)\").alias(\"Temp_Prom\"))\r\n    .orderBy(\"Fecha\")\r\n)\r\n",
